cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Flavenz Kernel for Xiaomi POCO F6 (Peridot)
message: >-
  Custom GKI 6.1 kernel for Xiaomi POCO F6 / Redmi Turbo 3 (peridot,
  Snapdragon 8s Gen 3 / SM8635) with KernelSU Next, SUSFS root concealment,
  and Droidspaces container support. Built via GitHub Actions in two
  flavors: guidix-full (ACK + Qualcomm CLO) and ack-full (pure ACK).
type: software
authors:
